00:24:34.308 --> 00:24:35.976
That is me! She's talking about me!

467
00:24:43.025 --> 00:24:46.028
This is also dedicated
to my goddaughter, Nora.

468
00:24:46.653 --> 00:24:47.654
I love you.

469
00:24:50.407 --> 00:24:53.744
<i>The snow glows white
On the mountain tonight</i>

470
00:24:53.827 --> 00:24:56.622
<i>Not a footprint to be seen</i>

471
00:24:57.497 --> 00:25:03.253
<i>A kingdom of isolation
And it looks like I'm the queen</i>

472
00:25:05.130 --> 00:25:11.553
<i>The wind is howling
Like this swirling storm inside</i>

473
00:25:12.095 --> 00:25:17.809
<i>Couldn't keep it in
Heaven knows I've tried</i>

474
00:25:19.269 --> 00:25:26.026
<i>Don't let them in, don't let them see
Be the good girl you always have to be</i>

475
00:25:26.109 --> 00:25:32.199
<i>Conceal, don't feel
Don't let them know</i>

476
00:25:32.282 --> 00:25:35.577
<i>Well, now they know</i>

477
00:25:35.661 --> 00:25:39.206
<i>Let it go, let it go</i>

478
00:25:39.289 --> 00:25:42.501
<i>Can't hold it back anymore</i>

479
00:25:42.584 --> 00:25:46.129
<i>Let it go, let it go</i>

480
00:25:46.213 --> 00:25:50.217
<i>Turn away and slam the door</i>

481
00:25:50.300 --> 00:25:56.723
<i>I don't care what they're going to say</i>

482
00:25:56.807 --> 00:26:00.727
<i>Let the storm rage on</i>

483
00:26:00.811 --> 00:26:04.731
<i>The cold never bothered me anyway</i>

484
00:26:20.122 --> 00:26:22.165
-<i>Ted.</i>
-<i>Dad?</i>

485
00:26:22.666 --> 00:26:23.667
Ted?

486
00:26:25.085 --> 00:26:26.086
Ted.

487
00:26:29.631 --> 00:26:30.924
It's okay.

488
00:26:31.550 --> 00:26:32.593
Try to breathe.

489
00:26:32.676 --> 00:26:37.097
I can't. I don't know what's going on.
I'm-- I'm sorry.

490
00:26:37.181 --> 00:26:40.559
It's okay. You're having a panic attack.
Just breathe.

491
00:26:42.644 --> 00:26:43.979
Am I going crazy?

492
00:26:44.897 --> 00:26:46.398
No more than anyone else.

493
00:26:49.193 --> 00:26:50.777
All right. You're all right.

494
00:26:52.613 --> 00:26:57.868
There we go. There we go.
There we go. Come on.

495
00:26:58.744 --> 00:26:59.745
Come on.

496
00:27:05.876 --> 00:27:06.960
There we go.

497
00:27:07.711 --> 00:27:09.463
I think I need to call it a night.

498
00:27:09.546 --> 00:27:13.008
Gonna go back to the hotel and
just get a good night's rest, you know?

499
00:27:13.091 --> 00:27:15.010
Would you like me to walk back with you?

500
00:27:15.886 --> 00:27:16.887
Do you want to take my car?

501
00:27:16.970 --> 00:27:19.848
No, no, no. I'm okay.
Thank you though. I appreciate it.

502
00:27:19.932 --> 00:27:21.683
-All right.
-Okay.

503
00:27:26.313 --> 00:27:29.608
Hey, do me a favor. Just, uh, let Beard
know I went back to the hotel.

504
00:27:29.691 --> 00:27:32.236
Of course. You just get home safely.

505
00:27:32.319 --> 00:27:33.654
-Okay, thank you.
-All right.

506
00:27:34.446 --> 00:27:35.697
Okay.

507
00:28:52.524 --> 00:28:55.110
-Excuse me. Very drunk man coming through.
-Yeah.

508
00:28:55.194 --> 00:28:58.447
Guys. Guys, guys, guys. I think
we should take the boys to the pub.

509
00:28:58.822 --> 00:29:01.742
Oh, I am so done, Sass. Sorry.

510
00:29:01.825 --> 00:29:03.911
Think I'm tapping out
for the evening too, actually.

511
00:29:03.994 --> 00:29:08.081
So I have to take 18
young, handsome men all by myself?

512
00:29:08.165 --> 00:29:09.958
Oh, trauma.

513
00:29:10.042 --> 00:29:12.419
-All right then. See you later.
-Bye. I love you.

514
00:29:12.503 --> 00:29:15.422
<i>Amigos,</i> I can't find my tropical shirt.

515
00:29:15.506 --> 00:29:16.507
He's so drunk.

516
00:29:16.590 --> 00:29:18.675
You won't need it, you won't need it.

517
00:29:18.759 --> 00:29:20.427
Right, want a lift back to the hotel?

518
00:29:20.511 --> 00:29:24.765
Oh, no.
Um, I think I'm gonna walk, actually.

519
00:29:29.061 --> 00:29:31.021
Unless you want me to come with you,
'cause that I can do.

520
00:29:31.104 --> 00:29:33.357
-I'm fine. Really.
-Yeah?

521
00:29:33.440 --> 00:29:35.526
Besides, that was yesterday.

522
00:29:37.778 --> 00:29:40.280
-You're wasting valuable time.
-Yeah, yeah. I'm going, I'm going.

523
00:30:00.467 --> 00:30:01.635
Oh, this is me.

524
00:30:02.678 --> 00:30:06.348
I'm sharing a suite with Rebecca.
We've got separate bedrooms though.

525
00:30:22.990 --> 00:30:24.074
Good night.

